  "signal": "Eligible automatically configured 1 MiB TCP peers sample monotonic stream read awaits. In at least 250 ms require three or more read waits of at least 3 ms accounting for at least 25% of the interval. Target 50 ms of decoded piece bytes clamped to 32–48 blocks. Growth requires at least 32 requests outstanding, an unchoked peer, unlimited download and sufficient advertised remote queue. Local processing contributes only to elapsed denominator.",
